        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a  chaotic, ball-bouncing arcade roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game currently features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟥 5 different characters with unique playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟩 25+ colorful block types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟨 30+ tools to upgrade your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟦 Unlockable items and achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes around 20-30 minutes, and everything can be unlocked in 3-4 hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Team 🛠️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is the first game from a newly formed studio by two Danish indie dev friends who developed this game all in their spare time. Our aim is to create small games packed with a lot of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We really hope you'll enjoy our first little game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a  chaotic, ball-bouncing arcade roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/f7e6f1a881a6fbe43248fe73a60c8aa5.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.poster.avif?t=1762808065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.webm?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/6a6c1f584417d1cf23cc2963effc61bf.mp4?t=1762808065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game currently features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟥 5 different characters with unique playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟩 25+ colorful block types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟨 30+ tools to upgrade your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟦 Unlockable items and achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes around 20-30 minutes, and everything can be unlocked in 3-4 hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Team 🛠️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is the first game from a newly formed studio by two Danish indie dev friends who developed this game all in their spare time. Our aim is to create small games packed with a lot of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We really hope you'll enjoy our first little game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
